{"ref":"BDB, חָצָץ","hw":"חָצָץ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָצָץ</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>gravel (</strong>as <em>divided, comminuted;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצִיצָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܨܳܨܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>—only abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.17\">Pr 20:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.16\">La 3:16</a> [<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצָצֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:18\" href=\"/Psalms.77.18\">ψ 77:18</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֵץ²\" href=\"/BDB,_חֵץ²\", dir=\"rtl\">חֵץ</a>].—<span dir=\"rtl\">יִמָּלֵּא־פִיהוּ ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.17\">Pr 20:17</a> fig. of a liar; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּגְרֵס בח׳ שִׁנָּ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.16\">La 3:16</a> <em>and he hath crushed my teeth with gravel-stones</em>, fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s dealings with sufferer.","next":"BDB, חֵץ²","prev":"BDB, חָצַץ"}